  "design": {
    "idea": "Dramatic zero-pit ankle boot hub staging the giant's thunderous first step: push the oil crate north into the tilting grate so Left Step latches the west boot plate and Right Step slides it across to latch the east plate, unsealing the Shin Grate.",
